<title>GEORGIA: Georgia Jan-Sep trade gap widens to $302.7 mln.</title>
<headline>Georgia Jan-Sep trade gap widens to $302.7 mln.</headline>
<dateline>TBILISI 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Georgia's foreign trade deficit widened to $302.7 million in the first nine months of this year from a deficit of $119.8 million in January-September last year, the State Department for Social and Economic Information said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>GEORGIA MERCHANDISE TRADE  Jan-Sep 96 Jan-Aug 96 Jan-Sep 95</p>
<p>    exports ($ million)	   135.5	117.2	100.8</p>
<p>    imports			   438.2	363.8	220.6</p>
<p>    trade balance		  -302.7     -246.6     -119.8</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
